4,Descriptive grammar of pashai: the language and speech,"https://theswissbay.ch/pdf/Books/Linguistics/Mega+linguistics+pack/Indo-European/Indo-Aryan/Pashai,+A+Descriptive+Grammar+of+(Lehr).pdf","Pashai speakers are distinguished as the westernmost speakers of an Indo-Aryan language. Native theories locate the Pashai speakers in this region since the ‘time of Adam’. In other words, they believe themselves to be original inhabitants.","Pashai, Northwest",Indo-European
