6,Northwest Pashai,https://lingweb.eva.mpg.de/channumerals/Pashai-Northwest.htm,"Northwest Pashai is spoken by approximately 70,000 speakers in northwest of Kabul, Kabul province, as well as Kapisa, Kunar, Laghman, and Nuristan provinces; some in Nangarhar and Parwan provinces; Alisheng valley and others north of Sarobi, Afghanistan.","Pashai, Northwest",Indo-European
